# 17. Nested Loop Example from Practice

Example of searching a target in a 2D array:

```java
static void searchTarget(int[][] arr, int target) {

    for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {

        for (int j = 0; j < arr[i].length; j++) {

            if (arr[i][j] == target) {
                System.out.println(
                    "Target is in row " + i +
                    " and column " + j
                );
            }
        }
    }
}
```

For a square `n × n` array:

```text
Rows = n
Columns = n

Total checks = n × n

Time = O(n²)
```

The algorithm only uses a fixed number of variables:

```text
i
j
target
```

Therefore:

```text
Space = O(1)
```

